OL,3,ACensus should include black English and
OL,4,AAsian English options, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next census should include more
OL,7,Fethnicity options to allow people to
OL,8,Fdefine themselves as black English or
OL,9,FAsian English, according to a group of
OL,10,FMPs.
OL,12,FLiberal Democrat MP Josh Babarinde told
OL,13,Fthe BBC that "most people" in the
OL,14,Fcountry believe "you don't have to be
OL,15,Fwhite to be English", as he called for
OL,16,Fthe categories to be updated in a
OL,17,Fsimilar way to changes in Wales and
OL,18,FScotland.
OL,20,FAt the 2021 census, the ethnic group
OL,21,Fsection saw English offered only within
OL,22,Fthe white category.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
